 "titulo": "If they found out she was a woman, she died 🗡️ Mulan Part 1 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "12 SCROLLS, 1 NAME",
 "descripcion": "The army lists arrived in twelve scrolls, and every one had her father's name. He was old and sick. So Mulan bought a horse in four markets and rode to war in his place.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you have gone in his place?\n\nFrom The Ballad of Mulan (Mulan ci), a Chinese folk poem from the Northern Wei era (5th-6th century), preserved in Guo Maoqian's Yuefu Shiji. A legend, not a historical record.\n#mulan #chinesehistory #legend #ancientchina #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Twelve army scrolls arrived in the village, and every single one had the same name.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Her *father's* name.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The Khan was calling every family to war on the northern border.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Mulan's father was old, and too sick to hold a sword.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He had no grown son. She had no older brother.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At the loom, Mulan stopped weaving and only *sighed*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "If a woman was caught in the army, the punishment was death.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She went anyway.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In the east market she bought a horse. In the west, a saddle.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In the south, a bridle. In the north, a long whip.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the poem says she left before dawn, without a goodbye.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She tied her hair like a man and put on her father's armor.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "By sunset she camped beside the *Yellow River*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She couldn't hear her mother calling her name anymore.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Only the roar of the river, and the cold.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The next night she reached the Black Mountains.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "And in the dark she heard *enemy horses*, neighing on the other side.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "Thousands of them. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
